   "title": "How to use",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## H3 image edit — Apple Silicon (MPS)\n\n1. **Load your images** in Reference 1 (the scene) and Reference 2 (the asset). Add more references by connecting a LoadImage to the next free `ref_image_N` slot on the H3 node (up to 5).\n2. **Write the instruction.** Refer to images as `<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`. Shape: `Task: Reference-guided generation.` → what each picture supplies (and does NOT supply) → the edit, with \"exactly one\" → what must stay.\n3. **Output size**: match the scene's aspect. 4 MP makes small lettering legible; 2 MP is faster.\n4. **Queue.** ~7–13 min at 4 MP on an M5. Result lands in `output/h3_edit/`.\n\nNeeds: the `h3_single_frame` custom node from this repo (restart ComfyUI after linking), ComfyUI-GGUF, ComfyUI-ClipProj, comfyui-obvpm (beta57). Models: see the repo README.\n\nLeave group 3 alone. `length` must stay 1 — that is what makes the video model render a still."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## H3 image edit — Apple Silicon (MPS)\n\n1. **Load your images** in Reference 1 (the scene) and Reference 2 (the asset). Add more references by connecting a LoadImage to the next free `ref_image_N` slot on the H3 node (up to 5).\n2. **Write the instruction.** Refer to images as `<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`. Shape: `Task: Reference-guided generation.` → what each picture supplies (and does NOT supply) → the edit, with \"exactly one\" → what must stay.\n3. **Output size**: match the scene's aspect. 4 MP makes small lettering legible; 2 MP is faster.\n4. **Queue.** ~7–13 min at 4 MP on an M5. Result lands in `output/h3_edit/`.\n\nNeeds: the `h3_single_frame` custom node from this repo (restart ComfyUI after linking), ComfyUI-GGUF, ComfyUI-ClipProj, comfyui-obvpm (beta57). Models: see the repo README.\n\nLeave group 3 alone. `length` must stay 1 — that is what makes the video model render a still."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
